<title>RUSSIA: Norilsk rises in surging Moscow.</title>
<headline>Norilsk rises in surging Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ordinary shares in metals company Norilsk Nickel jumped 10 percent to $6.90 from Thursday's closing $6.25 amid double-digit percentage gains for many leading Russian shares.</p>
<p>Norilsk preferred  NKEL_p.RTS were up 15 percent at $4.65 after closing at $4.05.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
